Licence note: the loader metadata of Factory Blocks declares MIT
(`fabric.mod.json:17` and `neoforge.mods.toml:3`), while its Modrinth project
page lists CC0-1.0 and the repository carries no LICENSE file. Both are
permissive and allow derivative works; this file carries the MIT text the
mod's own metadata declares. The discrepancy is recorded in
`LICENSE-NOTICE.md` and in the upstream analysis (`FINDINGS.md`).

